es store, west, east. West: {westPan} lb. East: {eastPan} lb.","when":[],"award":"","move":"crane.one","to":""}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Two","label":"2 lb crane","x":0,"y":-5,"style":"winch","rules":[{"line":"The crane cycles store, west, east. West: {westPan} lb. East: {eastPan} lb.","when":[],"award":"","move":"crane.two","to":""}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Four","label":"4 lb crane","x":8,"y":-4,"style":"winch","rules":[{"line":"The crane cycles store, west, east. West: {westPan} lb. East: {eastPan} lb.","when":[],"award":"","move":"crane.four","to":""}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Brake","label":"Set the brake","x":0,"y":8,"style":"lever","rules":[{"line":"The pointer rests at the notch. The casting lift engages.","when":[{"signal":"level","value":1}],"award":"balanceKey","move":"","to":""},{"line":"West {westPan}, east {eastPan}. Hang every loose weight and bring the beam level.","when":[],"award":"","move":"","to":""}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Ticket","label":"Freight ticket","x":-12,"y":7,"style":"leaf","rules":[{"line":"The western shipping bell weighs one pound before any loose freight lands. The removable ingots weigh one, two and four. Every ingot must leave its rack.","when":[],"award":"","move":"","to":""}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Kiln","label":"Casting bed","x":0,"y":14,"style":"lift","rules":[{"line":"","when":[{"signal":"balanceKey","value":1}],"award":"","move":"","to":"CastingBed"},{"line":"The lift is still locked.","when":[],"award":"","move":"","to":""}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Home","label":"Cistern lift","x":-12,"y":-10,"style":"lift","rules":[{"line":"","when":[],"award":"","move":"","to":"SumpHall"}],"note":0},{"id":"A_Brannic","label":"Brannic the foreman","x":-10,"y":-6.6,"style":"person","rules":[{"line":"BRANNIC  /  Four wage counters on my scale that morning. One came back with nobody to collect it. I kept it under the pan.","when":[],"award":"wage","move":"","to":""}],"note":2}],"visuals":[{"node":"BalanceBeam","signal":"tilt","kind":"roll","amount":3,"match":1},{"node":